# Social colours

Use these colours for social media graphics and other promotional tiles, such as a post about a new civica release or a household's first automation. They are not for the Home Assistant interface: for dashboards, use [Web colours](colour-web.html). Social colours do not change with the household's theme colour.

The social palette has every primary colour, tint, shade and accent, because a post needs to stand out in a busy feed.

