## Use colour to reflect tone

Choose colours for what the post needs to do. A power cut notice needs to feel serious and practical. A tip about a first automation can be bolder, so that it stands out.

### From most informative to most inspiring

Five posts, from the most informative on the left to the most inspiring on the right. Notice how the colour moves from black and white, through a dark shade, Primary blue and a tonal colour, to a companion colour.

